"tail`` to tail the logs of the worker, nginx y guacd services. Individual "
"services puede ser tailed by specifying el servicio, por ejemplo "
"``morpheus-worker-ctl tail worker``"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:247
msgid "VDI Gateway Docker Install"
msgstr "VDI Gateway Docker Install"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:249
msgid ""
"To Use VDI Gateway within a Docker container, a few pieces of information"
" are needed."
msgstr ""
"To Use VDI Gateway dentro de a Docker container, a few pieces of "
"information are needed."

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:251
msgid ""
"Firstly, in |morpheus|, go to **Tools > VDI Pools > VDI Gateways** and "
"create a new VDI Gateway Record. Be sure to set the HTTPS URL as "
"|morpheus| will need to be able to redirect the user's browser to that "
"page. An API Key will be generated. Make note of this as you will need it"
" later."
msgstr ""
"Firstly, in |morpheus|, go to **Tools > VDI Pools > VDI Gateways** y "
"create a new VDI Gateway Record. Be sure to set the HTTPS URL as "
"|morpheus| will necesitan ser able to redirect the user's browser to that "
"page. An API Key será generated. Make note of this as you will need it "
"later."

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:253
msgid "Now Simply run with:"
msgstr "Now Simply run with:"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:255
msgid ""
"docker run -d -p 8443:8443  -e MORPHEUS_SELF_SIGNED=true -e "
"MORPHEUS_KEY=[apiKey] -e MORPHEUS_URL=https://my.morpheusAppliance.url "
"morpheusdata/morpheus-worker:latest``"
msgstr ""
"docker run -d -p 8443:8443  -e MORPHEUS_SELF_SIGNED=true -e "
"MORPHEUS_KEY=[apiKey] -e MORPHEUS_URL=https://my.morpheusAppliance.url "
"morpheusdata/morpheus-worker:latest``"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:259
msgid ""
"This will setup an HTTPS self-signed exposed port on 8443 for the vdi "
"gateway. It is highly recommended to use valid certificates on your VDI "
"Gateways. It could be terminated at the VIP or a p12 SSL File can be used"
" and configured for the container."
msgstr ""
"This will setup an HTTPS self-signed exposed port on 8443 for the vdi "
"gateway. It is highly recomendado to use valid certificates on your VDI "
"Gateways. It could be terminated at the VIP o a p12 SSL File puede ser "
"used y configurado for the container."

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:261
msgid ""
"If the docker entrypoint detects a file at ``/etc/certs/cert.p12``, SSL "
"Will be enabled on port 8443 instead. be sure to set environment "
"variables ``MORPHEUS_SSL_ALIAS`` and ``MORPHEUS_SSL_PASSWORD`` when using"
" p12 files."
msgstr ""
"If the docker entrypoint detects a file at ``/etc/certs/cert.p12``, SSL "
"Will be habilitado on port 8443 instead. be sure establecer environment "
"variables ``MORPHEUS_SSL_ALIAS`` y ``MORPHEUS_SSL_PASSWORD`` when using "
"p12 files."

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:263
msgid ""
"If you wish to run in HTTP mode and SSL terminate at the VIP, you can run"
" the container like so:"
msgstr ""
"If you wish ejecutar in HTTP mode y SSL terminate at the VIP, you can run "
"the container like so:"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:265
msgid ""
"docker run -d -p 8080:8080  -e MORPHEUS_SELF_SIGNED=true -e "
"MORPHEUS_KEY=[apiKey] -e MORPHEUS_URL=https://my.morpheus.url "
"morpheusdata/morpheus-worker:latest"
msgstr ""
"docker run -d -p 8080:8080  -e MORPHEUS_SELF_SIGNED=true -e "
"MORPHEUS_KEY=[apiKey] -e MORPHEUS_URL=https://my.morpheus.url "
"morpheusdata/morpheus-worker:latest"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:270
msgid "VDI Gateway Helm Chart Installation"
msgstr "VDI Gateway Helm Chart Installation"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:272
msgid "First, configure the Helm repository:"
msgstr "First, configure the Helm repository:"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:274
msgid ""
"helm repo add morpheusdata https://gomorpheus.github.io/helm-charts-"
"morpheus/"
msgstr ""
"helm repo add morpheusdata "
"https://gomorpheus.github.io/helm-charts-morpheus/"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:278
msgid ""
"Next, install the |morpheus| worker using ``helm install``. You can "
"specify each parameter using ``--set key=value[,key=value]`` arguments as"
